0</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E4%B8%80%E5%91%BD%E4%BA%8C%E8%BF%90%E4%B8%89%E9%A3%8E%E6%B0%B4-%E4%B9%9D%E4%BA%A4%E8%B4%B5%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%81/</guid><description>现代人，越来越多的喜欢上了风水。 风水可以改变运气，从而变相改变人生，故有“一命二运三风水”之说，但很少人知道后面的话。 也正因为很少人知道，故</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%80%e5%91%bd%e4%ba%8c%e8%bf%90%e4%b8%89%e9%a3%8e%e6%b0%b4%20%e4%b9%9d%e4%ba%a4%e8%b4%b5%e4%ba%ba%e5%8d%81.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>夏日小记 | 一场际遇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</link><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0-%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA%E9%99%85%E9%81%87/</guid><description>01 一切都过去了 大家都知道杨医生爱喝茶。多伦多的道友也都知道，杨医生每次泡茶用的水都是开车去郊外打的山泉水&amp;hellip;今日有幸和杨医生一起</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%8f%e6%97%a5%e5%b0%8f%e8%ae%b0%20%e4%b8%80%e5%9c%ba%e9%99%85%e9%81%87.assets/640-1721835588333-49.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item><item><title>如是当下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/cultivation/%E5%A6%82%E6%98%AF%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>国外呆了很多年，我这个人特别懒得动。2019年也不知道哪根筋搭错了，屁颠屁颠地跑回中国，而且这一跑不得了。 从上海到成都然后藏地，又浙江 - 衢州</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a6%82%e6%98%af%e5%bd%93%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20240317112410137.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶桌闲谈</category><category>改命 Cultivation</category></item></channel></rss>